# LaTeX build artifacts — keep the repo clean for the Overleaf sync workflow.
# NOTE: do NOT add a blanket "*.pdf" here — figure PDFs under images/ are source
# files that Overleaf needs to compile. Only the root-level compiled main.pdf is ignored.

## Core auxiliary files
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fmt
*.fot

## Bibliography (bibtex / biblatex / biber)
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*-blx.aux
*-blx.bib

## latexmk / synctex build state
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.pdfsync

## Intermediate documents
*.dvi
*.xdv
*-converted-to.*

## Editor / OS cruft
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Compiled output (Overleaf compiles server-side; don't track the built PDF)
/main.pdf
